KAT Network Lab, third-party attribution
========================================

The simulation engine in this module (src/lib/network-lab/engine) is a
reimplementation of CS4G Netsim, an MIT-licensed open-source network simulator.
The device-script behaviours, port-based link resolution, trigger evaluation, and
the flood-meter arithmetic are ported from:

    https://github.com/errorinn/netsim

Only the mechanics are derived. The React UI, the warm design system, the level
instruction copy, and the device icons here are original to KAT. The origin's
Flaticon device images (by madebyoliver) are NOT reused; the UI renders its own
icons.

The origin project shipped the MIT licence template without filling in the
copyright line. It is reproduced verbatim below, with the source repository named
above as the copyright holder of record, as the MIT licence requires the notice to
be preserved.

